  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the given figure, a battery of emf <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math> is connected across a conductor <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math>&nbsp;and different area&nbsp;of cross-sections having radii <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/61c96039-4b24-409a-959c-bdcbd703bf08-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 188px;\" /></p><p>Choose the correct option as one moves from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
